---
// Contenedor que simula un celular en pantallas grandes (solo vista Estudiante)
---
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[390px]">
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] border-[10px] border-slate-900 bg-white shadow-2xl">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-900 px-4 pb-2 pt-3">
      <div class="h-5 w-28 rounded-full bg-slate-700"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-h-[78vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <slot />
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 border-t border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
      <span class="inline-block h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-slate-300"></span>
      <span>CampusConnect+ · Vista móvil estudiante</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
